  machine-readable quantities are Bird+2022's enclosed masses at median radii of 73 and 52 kpc, and a two-parameter
  exponential fit to sigma_r(r) that its own authors call 'a fitting function only'.  Everything below is
  therefore a 25-73 kpc test.  ITEM 38 IS MARKED UNDERPOWERED FOR ITS OWN STATED RANGE, not null.
  
